Yes — bombs are a great next piece. We’ll add **one falling bomb**. If the cat touches it: **BOOM**, lose 1 heart, and the bomb resets.

Here’s the new CodePen code:

```html
<div id="score">Score: 0</div>
<div id="hearts">❤️❤️❤️</div>
<div id="message"></div>
<button id="restartButton">Restart</button>

<div id="cat">🐱</div>
<div id="fish">🐟</div>
<div id="bomb">🔴</div>

<style>
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: skyblue;
    overflow: hidden;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  }

  #score {
    position: absolute;
    top: 10px;
